WEBVTT

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:20.230
They said you should be back in shipshape soon,

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:22.680
now that you've regained consciousness.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:30.360
What's wrong, Minhyung?

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:31.650
Minhyung!

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.820
Minhyung!

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:36.240
What's wrong?!

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:46.080
I'm scared. Get a grip, Minhyung!

00:00:57.050 --> 00:00:58.470
Prep the defibrillator.

00:00:58.780 --> 00:00:59.640
Yes, Doctor.

00:01:00.850 --> 00:01:02.720
Please save Minhyung!

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:05.310
Save him, please!

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:07.810
Could you take the lady outside?

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:09.190
Yes, Doctor.

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:11.690
You need to wait outside, ma'am.

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:13.990
Just a minute.

00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:16.490
Please, go outside.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.070
It's ready.

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:19.240
200 joules.

00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:20.320
200 joules.

00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:20.320
Clear!

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:26.040
One more time!

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.290
Clear!

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:15.860
One more time, at 200 joules.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:17.360
200 joules.

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:19.900
Clear!

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:26.330
Clear!

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:37.710
Miss Chelin.

00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:41.840
What's going on?

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:45.600
I heard Minhyung regained consciousness?

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:46.390
Mrs. Lee.

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:48.600
Minhyung's...

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:51.680
What if Minhyung...

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.520
What if something happened to him?

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:55.150
Calm down.

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:00.070
You can't come in here.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:02.200
I'm the patient's mother.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:02.740
Please let me in.

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:04.610
Let's up the charge and try again.

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:05.660
Yes, Doctor.

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:07.770
Please wait outside.

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:13.750
360 joules.

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:16.730
What are you waiting for?

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:18.420
We can't give up on a patient like this!

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:22.670
360 joules.

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:23.840
Clear!

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:33.230
One more time, at 360.

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:35.480
Clear!

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:47.620
One more time!

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:48.870
Clear!

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:54.580
Clear!

00:04:58.420 --> 00:04:59.200
Once more!

00:04:59.200 --> 00:04:59.920
Clear!

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:17.310
Mommy!

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:32.330
No!

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.330
Mommy!

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:36.790
No!

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:44.210
Joonsang!

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:49.140
<i>Minhyung.</i>

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:51.720
<i>Minhyung?</i>

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:57.480
It's okay.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:58.810
Calm down.

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:02.320
Just think of it as if you're watching a movie.

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:06.990
A fire inside a movie can't spread into real life.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:10.320
Calm down.

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:34.510
<i>Do you see the man who saved you?</i>

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:37.860
<i>It's Uncle Jack.</i>

00:06:37.860 --> 00:06:39.810
<i>Uncle Jack's the one who saved me.</i>

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:44.820
<i>Do you remember where it happened?</i>

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:50.530
<i>Reagan County, Texas...</i>

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:53.910
<i>My parents brought me here on vacation.</i>

00:06:58.040 --> 00:06:59.120
<i>Minhyung.</i>

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:00.710
Mommy!

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:03.250
I'm right over here.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:11.080
<i>It was the last family trip we had</i>

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:12.970
<i>before my father passed away in a plane accident.</i>

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:15.260
<i>What's your name?</i>

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:16.350
Minhyung.

00:07:17.850 --> 00:07:18.930
<i>What's your name?</i>

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:21.230
<i>My name is...</i>

00:07:24.230 --> 00:07:25.360
My name is...

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:28.190
<i>Stop falling asleep, Joonsang.</i>

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:32.350
There's not much more we can do.

00:07:30.740 --> 00:07:33.490
Don't do this, Minhyung!

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:34.990
Minhyung!

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:37.120
I'm sorry, Joonsang.

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:38.640
It's all my fault.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:40.410
So wake up, please?

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:43.120
Joonsang, I...

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:43.710
Get a hold of yourself, Yujin. Why do you keep doing this?

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:44.750
Stop that.

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:47.050
It's all my fault, Joonsang.

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:48.710
I'm sorry I didn't realize it was you.

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:51.380
So wake up, please.

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:53.180
Joonsang...

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:55.260
Doctor, take a look at this!

00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:55.260
Joonsang...

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:58.060
Doctor.

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:00.890
Three ml of epinephrine, Nurse.

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:01.660
Yes, Doctor.

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:07.360
BP 40.

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:12.700
70. He's stable.

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:16.240
Oh, Minhyung.

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:18.740
He should be all right now.

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:21.290
Minhyung...

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:25.290
Thank you.

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:28.790
Minhyung.

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:30.840
Be sure to check his vitals every ten minutes just in case.

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:31.670
Yes, Doctor.

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:32.670
Minhyung.

00:08:34.340 --> 00:08:35.510
Let me know as soon as you see a change in the patient.

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:36.720
Minhyung.

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:36.720
Yes, Doctor.

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:41.890
Thanks for coming back to us.

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:45.560
Thank goodness.

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:47.900
You have no idea how much you scared me.

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:50.650
Thank goodness.

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:52.230
Joonsang.

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:55.860
It must have been hard for you too.

00:08:57.570 --> 00:08:58.990
Thank goodness.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.370
Are you all right, Yujin?

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:08.380
Yujin?

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:27.020
What are you doing?

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:28.400
Stepping on shadows.

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:32.690
Do you know how to not feel lonely in the Land of Shadows?

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:33.610
How?

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:37.400
You just need to have someone remember your shadow.

00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:39.530
Like this.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.220
J-Joonsang...

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:05.930
Wait.

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:08.270
Joonsang!

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:10.440
Wait!

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:23.200
Joonsang!

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:42.220
Why're you awake already?

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:44.220
You should go back to sleep.

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:48.480
How do you feel?

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:49.940
I'm fine.

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:51.850
You had me worried.

00:10:57.780 --> 00:10:59.360
Hey, Sanghyuk,

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:00.700
I...

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:01.950
What a relief.

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:06.370
You're fine and Mr. Minhyung's regained consciousness too.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:12.370
I was really scared.

00:11:13.380 --> 00:11:15.880
If he had died there, I...

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:17.630
I know.

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:20.090
He got hurt trying to protect you, right?

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:23.140
He'll get better soon.

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:26.810
Both you and Mr. Minhyung will be able to go back to normal.

00:11:26.930 --> 00:11:28.970
Sanghyuk, Mr. Minhyung is actually—

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:30.180
Yujin.

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:33.730
Mom.

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:45.780
Excuse me, could I ask you a question?

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:46.370
Yes?

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:49.370
Could you tell me the status of Minhyung Lee, the patient in room 701?

00:11:50.330 --> 00:11:52.330
Why do you ask?

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:56.380
I actually wanted to check the name of his next of kin;

00:11:56.670 --> 00:11:58.050
is it Miss Mi Hee Kang?

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:00.300
You're a reporter, aren't you?

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:03.380
Yes, that's right.

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:07.800
Quite a few reporters have come by since she <i>is</i> a famous pianist.

00:12:08.010 --> 00:12:11.730
Mi Hee Kang the pianist, you say?

00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:14.300
And where are you from?

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:15.540
Are you from a TV station?

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:17.110
Or a newspaper?

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:19.860
Cancel all my performances for the time being.

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:22.400
There she is right now.

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:24.780
It might be hard to cancel this week's performance in Japan though.

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:26.200
Find a way.

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:29.080
And I trust you've put the sale of the house in Chuncheon on hold?

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:31.330
Yes, I did.

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:33.960
I'm going to stay here in Korea until Minhyung gets better.

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:45.430
What's the matter?

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:47.640
Nothing.

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:51.560
Nothing at all.

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:07.450
Yujin.

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:15.660
Can you really not remember me?

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:17.750
You're just playing a joke, right?

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:22.920
You're just teasing me even though you know it's me, aren't you?

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:28.590
All you have to do is wake up, Joonsang. {covers two japanese subs}

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:35.810
I don't care if you don't remember me.

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:39.270
I don't care if you're Minhyung Lee.

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:42.360
So just wake up.

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:18.890
Minhyung.

00:14:21.270 --> 00:14:22.610
You're back.

00:14:26.400 --> 00:14:28.320
You have no idea how scared I was.

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:31.990
I thought something had happened to you.

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:33.990
Don't worry.

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:35.490
I'm all right now.

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:36.750
Where's Mother?

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:39.270
I took her to the hotel.

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:41.460
The press must have been all over or something.

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:45.960
They said all they need to do now is run a few tests after you're stabilized,

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:47.300
so get some rest.

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:48.420
Thanks.

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:50.550
What date is it today?

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:54.970
You've been sleeping for four days straight.

00:14:55.100 --> 00:14:58.480
You kept waking up for a moment and then falling back asleep.

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:01.320
Your fashion show's coming up,

00:15:01.320 --> 00:15:03.770
so stop worrying about me and go back to Seoul.

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:08.610
How could I leave you when you're still in pain like this?

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:11.540
Go on back.

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:13.780
It's your first show, isn't it?

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:16.660
Don't you want to get a bouquet of flowers from me after the finale?

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:19.160
Minhyung...

00:15:22.170 --> 00:15:24.130
Be gentle, I'm still a patient.

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:26.040
Oh my.

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:28.460
Sorry.

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:30.300
What about Miss Yujin?

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:37.850
She wasn't seriously hurt, thanks to you.

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:40.180
She's leaving the hospital today.

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:46.480
Why didn't you tell me that you were working with Yujin?

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:48.020
Don't you remember?

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:51.050
I tried to tell you at the bar that day,

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:53.030
but you said you weren't interested.

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:58.700
In any case, it's a good thing.

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:01.920
Yujin and I are best friends,

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:04.120
so I hope you two can become friends through this as well.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:10.510
Why don't we drink some tea, Minhyung?

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:11.800
Just give me a minute.

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:22.230
Shh, she's coming.

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:25.600
Tada!

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:31.480
Congratulations on leaving the hospital, Yujin.

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:32.860
Congratulations.

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:35.700
I could get used to this.

00:16:36.070 --> 00:16:38.490
Oh, you'll regret saying that soon enough;

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:42.370
you're going to be knee deep in work when you come back.

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:47.380
And hence the "congratulations," right?

00:16:47.880 --> 00:16:51.460
Oh please, now I sound like some sort of an evil boss.

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:54.590
Fine, I'll cut you a break.

00:16:55.260 --> 00:16:56.920
Go on a date with your man today,

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:58.430
and show up to work tomorrow, okay?

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:01.590
It's okay.

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:02.600
I'll go right now.

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:05.770
I need to get back to Seoul right away too.

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:08.100
Sanghyuk, you...

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:09.970
Don't worry.

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:13.110
I'll go see how Happy's doing as soon as I get to Seoul.

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:15.610
You better.

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:18.200
I got it, I got it.

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:22.040
Are you really friends with that quack vet?

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:23.370
He's not a quack.

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:24.620
He's pretty dependable.

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:27.710
He really is, Jeong-a.

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:29.670
You can trust Happy with him.

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:33.170
Well, if you two say so.

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:46.410
I can't let a patient carry that.

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:47.190
I'll do it.

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:50.320
Oh yeah, you're going to see the Director before you leave, right?

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:52.360
You never know when you'll see him again after you go.

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:54.980
I heard you didn't even get to say "thanks."

00:17:59.990 --> 00:18:01.030
No.

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:06.960
I'll save it for another day.

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:09.960
I'll come back some other time.

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:21.800
I got you that rooibos tea you like.

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:24.220
Thanks.

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:32.810
Chelin.

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:38.070
Do you remember what you said when we first met in Paris?

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:41.280
How could I forget?

00:18:42.410 --> 00:18:44.530
Were you really born in America?

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:45.990
Where did you grow up?

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:48.490
Have you really never been to Korea?

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:49.660
Not even once?

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:55.800
Yes, but why?

00:18:58.590 --> 00:19:01.550
Did you use to know someone who looks like me or something?

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:06.720
Yeah, now that I think about it.

00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:09.770
I guess you could take it that way.

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:11.230
That way?

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:15.220
I was surprised when we met;

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:18.820
I couldn't honestly say it because my pride wouldn't allow it,

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:20.650
but how should I say it...

00:19:22.030 --> 00:19:25.070
I was just knocked off my feet

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:28.760
because you, a man who's so close to my ideal Mr. Right,

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:30.910
just suddenly appeared in front of me out of nowhere.

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:32.000
I see.

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:37.710
Then what about Yujin?

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:41.670
When she first saw me...

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:05.080
I only found out recently too.

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:06.780
That she's a famous pianist, that is.

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:09.950
Minhyung is quite tight-lipped after all.

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:12.910
Are you sure that's his mother?

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:14.870
Why do you ask?

00:20:16.790 --> 00:20:19.170
This is because of work, isn't it?

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:23.130
It's because you want to interview his mother, right?

00:20:23.470 --> 00:20:26.300
I almost forgot you run a classical music program.

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:30.180
I'll ask her for you.

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:32.730
Thanks.

00:20:33.060 --> 00:20:35.350
I have a favor to ask too.

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:38.020
Don't take this the wrong way,

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:44.150
but I don't want Minhyung to see Yujin for the time being.

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:46.910
Is it because of what happened that day?

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:54.120
Minhyung's still a patient.

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:58.210
I just don't want her going around confusing him by talking about Joonsang.

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:00.920
Are you sure <i>you're</i> not the one getting confused?

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:02.420
What are you implying?

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:07.720
There was nothing wrong with Yujin until Mr. Minhyung appeared.

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:09.930
Are you blaming me?

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:12.680
They're two different people.

00:21:13.060 --> 00:21:16.270
Yujin's the only one who's confused here.

00:21:17.230 --> 00:21:19.850
Minhyung even got hurt because of her, and—

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:20.690
Let's stop.

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:25.030
It'll never happen again, I promise.

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:31.410
It feels good to be out of the hospital, right?

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:34.660
Check out the amazing view outside.

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:37.240
Look over there.

00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:39.210
Doesn't it look like a snow flower?

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:40.580
Doesn't it?

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:44.710
Did something happen between you and Sanghyuk?

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:47.930
Why were you two so awkward around each other?

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:50.590
You have no idea how uncomfortable it was for me.

00:21:57.690 --> 00:21:59.600
I remember everything,

00:22:01.270 --> 00:22:03.520
but he can't remember anything.

00:22:04.070 --> 00:22:05.070
Yujin.

00:22:06.530 --> 00:22:09.240
It's almost as if those things didn't happen,

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:12.490
or as if my memories are false.

00:22:15.660 --> 00:22:19.710
He's still suffering and in pain,

00:22:21.330 --> 00:22:23.960
so is Sanghyuk, Chelin, and Mom...

00:22:24.960 --> 00:22:28.470
There's nothing I can do for them.

00:22:42.440 --> 00:22:44.320
It's really been a long time.

00:22:44.440 --> 00:22:46.030
I see you haven't changed, Doctor.

00:22:46.530 --> 00:22:49.110
How does it feel to be a doctor again, Jane?

00:22:50.320 --> 00:22:53.360
It feels as if nothing's changed here, except for me.

00:22:53.490 --> 00:22:56.040
It feels a little strange and a little embarrassing at the same time.

00:22:56.830 --> 00:22:59.040
I leave myself to your guidance, Doctor.

00:23:00.500 --> 00:23:04.250
I'm looking forward to working with such an able neurologist as you, Jane.

00:23:04.380 --> 00:23:06.170
Oh, please.

00:23:07.760 --> 00:23:08.300
Hello?

00:23:10.760 --> 00:23:12.300
What? Minhyung?

00:23:15.100 --> 00:23:16.930
Excuse me for one minute.

00:23:18.390 --> 00:23:19.770
How badly is he hurt?

00:23:19.930 --> 00:23:21.530
Elaborate.

00:23:21.530 --> 00:23:23.440
What happened to him now?

00:23:25.770 --> 00:23:26.820
Minhyung?

00:23:27.020 --> 00:23:29.740
Thankfully, he was able to regain consciousness,

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:34.280
but I'm scared; if something were to happen to him I'd...

00:23:34.910 --> 00:23:36.280
What should I do, Doctor?

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:38.580
Is this all my fault?
